      "claim": "Trazodone, a basic CNS-active amine, shows absolute oral bioavailability of 63–91% in fasted subjects; L3 oral exposure records show substantial AUCinf (~10.8–11.1 µg·h/mL) and Cmax (~1.6–1.7 µg/mL) after 100 mg oral, consistent with good absorption.",
